1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,690
(Leonard:)We're trying to get past
a security guard,

2
00:00:02,689 --> 00:00:04,419
(Leonard:)not rescue Zelda.

3
00:00:06,058 --> 00:00:08,728
(Sheldon:)I think what really needs to be
rescued is your sense of whimsy,

4
00:00:08,728 --> 00:00:10,628
(Sheldon:)but one quest at a time.

5
00:00:12,631 --> 00:00:14,461
(Sheldon:)So what's the plan?

6
00:00:14,467 --> 00:00:16,737
(Leonard:)Uh, I'm just gonna be honest
with the guy.

7
00:00:16,736 --> 00:00:19,066
(Sheldon:)Honesty will never
get us in.

8
00:00:19,072 --> 00:00:20,742
(Leonard:)Well, what's
your plan?

9
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:24,080
(Sheldon:)All right, my plan is
predicated on the assumption

10
00:00:24,077 --> 00:00:26,077
(Sheldon:)that they have
a nurse's office

11
00:00:26,079 --> 00:00:28,809
(Sheldon:)and your willingness
to be lightly stabbed.

12
00:00:36,855 --> 00:00:38,425
(Security Guard:)Who are you here to see?

13
00:00:38,425 --> 00:00:39,925
(Leonard:)Uh, I'm just gonna
tell you the truth.

14
00:00:39,926 --> 00:00:42,496
(Sheldon:)Oh, you are killing me.

15
00:00:42,495 --> 00:00:44,495
(Leonard:)We don't have
an appointment.

16
00:00:44,497 --> 00:00:46,497
We-we're just fans
of Mr. Lucas's work,

17
00:00:46,499 --> 00:00:47,829
(Leonard:)and we thought
we'd take a shot

18
00:00:47,834 --> 00:00:49,804
(Leonard:)and see if we could get in
and look around.

19
00:00:49,803 --> 00:00:51,233
(Security Guard:)Sorry, guys, we get this a lot.

20
00:00:51,237 --> 00:00:52,367
(Security Guard:)Can't let you in.

21
00:00:52,372 --> 00:00:56,142
(Sheldon:)What if I told you
that I was the voice of Yoda?

22
00:00:57,376 --> 00:01:02,026
(imitating Yoda): A recording
session I must attend.

